That&amp;rsquo;s a special horrific font with an intricate pattern of bones. All letters are put together of nonrecurring elements drawn individually by hand. The classical forms as we see it sound afresh with the bones attire.&lt;br&gt;
Design by Ivan Turetskyy, Lukyan Turetskyy&lt;/p&gt;
